(skywalker-x8-generated-canonical-plant-6dof)
*title Skywalker X8 generated canonical plant anchor
*mode rigid-body-6dof
*atmos standard
*earth wgs-84 omega=0.0
*runtime status vehicle reference-area=0.75 reference-length=0.36 dry-mass-kg=3.364 inertia-x=0.325 inertia-y=0.14 inertia-z=0.4 envelope-min-forward-speed=2 envelope-max-speed=27 envelope-max-alpha-deg=12 envelope-max-beta-deg=5
*runtime control throttle vehicle=1 default=0.5773431906 lower=0 upper=1
*runtime control collective-elevon-deg vehicle=1 default=-2.1478876544 lower=-20 upper=20
*runtime control differential-elevon-deg vehicle=1 default=-3.9378035934 lower=-20 upper=20



*runtime status actuator maximum-moment=20 maximum-body-rate-deg-s=360
*runtime status thermal policy=none
*define x8-cx
  x8-cx=(cx-static)+(cx-collective)-(cx-static)+(cx-differential)-(cx-static);
*define x8-cy
  x8-cy=(cy-static)+(cy-collective)-(cy-static)+(cy-differential)-(cy-static);
*define x8-cz
  x8-cz=(cz-static)+(cz-collective)-(cz-static)+(cz-differential)-(cz-static);
*define x8-cmx
  x8-cmx=(cmx-static)+(cmx-collective)-(cmx-static)+(cmx-differential)-(cmx-static);
*define x8-cmy
  x8-cmy=(cmy-static)+(cmy-collective)-(cmy-static)+(cmy-differential)-(cmy-static);
*define x8-cmz
  x8-cmz=(cmz-static)+(cmz-collective)-(cmz-static)+(cmz-differential)-(cmz-static);

*trajectory 1 x8 start on 1
  *initial ecic x=6378315.0 y=0.0 z=0.0 xdt=0.0 ydt=17.9 zdt=0.0 qw=0.5332552264 qx=-0.5332552264 qy=-0.4643693180 qz=0.4643693180 time=0.0 mass=3.364 propellant_mass=0.0
  *segment 1 canonical-plant-anchor
    *integ dtprnt=0.05 dt=0.005

    *aero cx=x8-cx cy=x8-cy cz=x8-cz cmx=x8-cmx cmy=x8-cmy cmz=x8-cmz


    *when time>0.1 stop
*end
